          },
          "elements": [
            {
              "id": "abt_st_tx",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "html",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<div style=\"padding-left:48px;font-family:Outfit,sans-serif;\"><div style=\"display:inline-block;background:#EDE9FE;color:#7C3AED;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:50px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:16px;\">📖 Our Story</div><h2 style=\"font-size:40px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 24px;\">Built to Transform<br><span style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2563EB,#7C3AED);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text;\">Careers</span></h2><p style=\"color:#6B7280;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;\">DMIT was founded in 2018 with a simple mission: make world-class digital marketing education accessible to every Sri Lankan professional. What started as a small classroom in Colombo has grown into the country's most trusted digital marketing institute.</p><p style=\"color:#6B7280;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;\">Our founder, a veteran digital marketing strategist with over 15 years of international experience, recognized a gap between industry needs and what was being taught in traditional academic settings.</p><p style=\"color:#6B7280;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:28px;\">Today, we have trained over 5,000 students who now work at Google, Meta, HubSpot, and leading agencies across Asia. Our curriculum is continuously updated to stay ahead of industry trends.</p><a href=\"/courses\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#0F172A;color:#fff;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:50px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;font-family:Outfit,sans-serif;\">Explore Courses →</a></div>"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

